---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy Backyard Sauna Pro"
  description="Privacy policy for BackyardSaunaPro.com"
  canonical="/privacy"
>
  <article class="max-w-2xl mx-auto prose prose-stone">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-stone-500 text-sm mb-6">Last updated: August 15, 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">We collect information you choose to provide, such as an email address submitted for the buying checklist or newsletter, information included in an email, and a sauna-planning request you explicitly submit. A planning request can include your first name, email, optional phone number, ZIP or region, budget, timeline, project requirements, and notes. We also collect standard usage information such as pages viewed, approximate location, device and browser type, referral source, and interactions with links and forms.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">How We Use Information</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">We use information to deliver requested resources, operate and improve the site, understand which guides and links are useful, prevent abuse, respond to messages, and measure affiliate and campaign performance. We do not ask analytics providers to store names, email addresses, phone numbers, or free-form lead details.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">Service Providers</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">We currently use Google Analytics for site measurement, Kit for email signup and delivery, Cloudflare Workers and D1 for secure planning-request receipt and storage, and affiliate or retailer platforms for link attribution. Those providers process data under their own terms and privacy policies. Submitting a newsletter form sends the address to Kit. Project-request details are not sent to Google Analytics.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">This site may use cookies for analytics purposes. Amazon and other affiliate partners may also set cookies on your device when you click affiliate links. We do not control third-party cookies.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">This site participates in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program and other affiliate programs. When you click a product link, the retailer may set tracking cookies to attribute your purchase. We receive a commission if you make a qualifying purchase.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">This site contains links to external websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">Choices and Retention</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">Marketing emails include an unsubscribe option. You can also block or delete cookies through your browser. We retain planning requests while they are being reviewed and for up to 12 months afterward for follow-up, duplicate prevention, and program measurement, unless a longer period is legally required. You may ask us to delete a request sooner.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">Data Sharing</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 mb-4">We do not sell homeowner information through an automated marketplace. We may share a submitted project with one relevant sauna seller or installer only when you separately select the partner-sharing option and after a manual fit review. We record whether that consent was given. We may also share limited data with service providers that operate the site, with affiliate platforms when you follow a tracked link, or when required by law.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-6 mb-2">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600">For privacy questions, access requests, or deletion requests, use our <a href="/contact/" class="text-amber-700 underline">contact page</a>. This operational summary is not a substitute for legal advice; material changes to data collection or lead sharing require owner and legal review.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
